  unitName: Floral Princess Rosetta
  unitId: 30546
  unitNumber: 1345
  description: Rosetta donned the equipment that the gods had presented to her, and
    continue fighting the human race. The gods granted her even more power as a reward
    for serving them faithfully, but such power was ultimately beyond human limitations.
    Rosetta then decided to sacrifice her life to the gods as their divine soldier,
    when the goddess that had saved her mother suddenly appeared and spoke to her.
    With a soft expression on her face, Rosetta fell into a peaceful slumber immediately
    afterwards. Rumors say that a single beautiful and vivid flower bloomed where
    she lay to rest.
  summonDesc: I have no regrets.<br>However, next time I'd like to be reborn as an
    innocent flower, never having known battle...
  fusionDesc: Withering flowers are beautiful.<br>I will continue serving the gods<br>and
    fight until the very end.
  evoDesc: I won't falter.<br>These magnificent flowers around me will always show
    me the way!
  element: 3
  rarity: 6
